Atlas overlay patch 0102: ui/kit-context-menu
Why: the row menu of the downloads list (reel scene 7, P23: Open, Open With..., Share..., Show in Files,
separator, Move to Trash) is a Kit popover when the Kit chrome is on (ADR 0062): the engine's menu model
(the one HOST's 0041 builds) stays the source of the entries and their commands, the Kit draws them
(chrome/browser/ui/atlas/kit/kit_menu.cc). One call at the top of DownloadUiContextMenuView::Run; it
returns false (the engine's menu runner shows the menu) unless the browser starts with --atlas-kit-chrome.
Files: chrome/browser/ui/views/download/download_ui_context_menu_view.cc,
 chrome/browser/ui/views/download/BUILD.gn
Test filter: *AtlasKit*
Rebase risk: L (one include, one call before the menu runner is made, one dep line)
Release: 0.13
License: GPL-3.0-or-later (hunks in files the inherited series patches)
Verified at: 156.0.8078.79, prepared tree with the inherited and platform series applied

